PKG=dropbear
NAME=Dropbear 2025.88: SSH server and client
ARCH=m68k
VERSION=2025.88-1
CATEGORY=network
CLASSES=none
VENDOR=Ash Nazag
DESC=SSH server (dropbear, started at boot on port 22, log in /var/adm/dropbear.log) and client (dbclient, also as ssh), with dropbearkey. curve25519 key exchange and ed25519 keys only. Accounts without a password cannot log in: set one or put a key in ~/.ssh/authorized_keys. Host key made on first connection in /opt/amix/etc/dropbear. Needs prngd.
